FIND-001 (critical) real-run evidence — 2026-07-04
====================================================

Finding: the ¥500 paid-gate was only proven via a DOM-eval print (SINGLE_PRICE_TYPE/SINGLE_PRICE_VALUE),
never visually captured. REQ-20 requires the human/verifier to SEE it in a screenshot. lib/note-set-single-price.py
took its ONLY screenshot AFTER already clicking キャンセル to close the 公開に進む overlay, so that
screenshot never showed the panel at all.

Fix: lib/note-set-single-price.py now takes a SEPARATE screenshot (single-price-panel-<key>.png) of the
overlay WHILE 記事タイプ=有料 and the price are still visibly selected/filled on screen, BEFORE the
キャンセル click. Two independent REAL runs (no simulation, no mock) prove this:

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
RUN 1 — direct re-run of the FIXED script against the EXISTING nfb2ace9f0ed8 draft (the exact draft
CRIT-105/FIND-001 name), a real, already-live note.com draft on the anicca123 account:

